Z||000009||gargoyle||10-02-2001||10:47 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> Hello everybody. Just answering a couple of questions. MM, I only have one. That is the same one from ebay and no you can't have it. I don't see why it couldn't be used on a notch. Actually they sell these just as the tail portion and you have to glass it to a hood. I lucked out and fond one that was already glassed togeather. By the way it is the same as the pics that MM put up and the one on california kids car. His was the first I saw. I really like the look of it over the GT wing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
